  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "lmdb security update",
      "Title": "Synopsis",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for lmdb is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1,openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3,openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4,openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4,openEuler-22.03-LTS-SP4",
      "Title": "Summary",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Symas LMDB is an extraordinarily fast, memory-efficient database we developed for the OpenLDAP Project. With memory-mapped files, it has the read performance of a pure in-memory database while retaining the persistence of standard disk-based databases.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nOpenLDAP Lightning Memory-Mapped Database (LMDB) versions up to and including 0.9.14, prior to commit 8e1fda8, contain a heap buffer underflow in the readline() function of mdb_load. When processing malformed input containing an embedded NUL byte, an unsigned offset calculation can underflow and cause an out-of-bounds read of one byte before the allocated heap buffer. This can cause mdb_load to crash, leading to a limited denial-of-service condition.(CVE-2026-22185)",
      "Title": "Description",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for lmdb is now available for openEuler-20.03-LTS/openEuler-20.03-LTS/openEuler-22.03-LTS/openEuler-22.03-LTS/openEuler-24.03-LTS/openEuler-24.03-LTS/openEuler-24.03-LTS-Next/openEuler-24.03-LTS-Next/openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1/openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1/openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3/openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP3/openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4/openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP4/openEuler-20.03-LTS-SP4/openEuler-22.03-LTS-SP4.\n\nopenEuler Security has rated this update as having a security impact of medium. A Common Vunlnerability Scoring System(CVSS)base score,which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVElink(s) in the References section.",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Medium",
      "Title": "Severity",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "lmdb",
      "Title": "Affected Component",
      "Type": "General"
    }
  ],
